<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3DO cut by Alex Brown.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3DO cut by Alex Brown.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Thursday it lowered its rating on the shares of 3DO Co to a market perform from a buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/32 to 4-13/32.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
